            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over mij"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access Your Photos": {
      "comment": "The empty-state title prompting the user to grant photo access.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toegang tot je foto's"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Sessions": {
      "comment": "The title of the active sessions screen.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actieve sessies"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All purchases have been restored.\nPlease remember that only previously bought non-consumable products and auto-renewable subscriptions can be restored.": {
      "comment": "The message string for restoring IAP has succeeded.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle aankopen zijn hersteld.\nLet op: alleen eerder gekochte niet-verbruikbare producten en automatisch verlengende abonnementen kunnen worden hersteld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Access": {
      "comment": "The button that requests photo library access.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef toegang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow access to your photo library to choose a profile picture.": {
      "comment": "The empty-state detail prompting the user to grant photo access.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef toegang tot je fotobibliotheek om een profielfoto te kiezen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are you sure you want to delete your account? Once your account is deleted, all of its resources and data will be permanently deleted. Please enter your password to confirm you would like to permanently delete your account.": {
      "comment": "The confirmation message shown before permanently deleting an account.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weet u zeker dat u uw account wilt verwijderen? Zodra uw account is verwijderd, worden alle bijbehorende bronnen en gegevens permanent verwijderd. Voer uw wachtwoord in om te bevestigen dat u uw account permanent wilt verwijderen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "authenticate to continue.": {
      "comment": "The biometric prompt reason shown when returning to the locked app on Mac.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "authenticeer om door te gaan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "authenticate to disable app lock.": {
      "comment": "The biometric prompt reason shown when disabling app lock on Mac.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "authenticeer om appvergrendeling uit te schakelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authenticate to disable app lock.": {
      "comment": "The biometric prompt reason shown when disabling app lock.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticeer om appvergrendeling uit te schakelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "authenticate to enable app lock.": {
      "comment": "The biometric prompt reason shown when enabling app lock on Mac.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "authenticeer om appvergrendeling in te schakelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authenticate to enable app lock.": {
      "comment": "The biometric prompt reason shown when enabling app lock.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticeer om appvergrendeling in te schakelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication could not continue because the user has been locked out of biometric authentication, due to failing authentication too many times.": {
      "comment": "The error shown when the user is locked out of biometric authentication.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticatie kon niet doorgaan omdat de gebruiker is buitengesloten van biometrische authenticatie, omdat de authenticatie te vaak is mislukt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication could not start because the device does not support biometric authentication.": {
      "comment": "The error shown when the device does not support biometric authentication.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticatie kon niet starten omdat het apparaat geen biometrische authenticatie ondersteunt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication could not start because the user has not enrolled in biometric authentication.": {
      "comment": "The error shown when the user has not enrolled in biometric authentication.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticatie kon niet starten omdat de gebruiker zich niet heeft aangemeld voor biometrische authenticatie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication is required every time you return to the app.": {
      "comment": "The string for requiring authentication immediately.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verificatie is vereist telkens wanneer u terugkeert naar de app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication is required if the app remains in the background for more than %@.": {
      "comment": "The string for the 'Authentication Interval' settings description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verificatie is vereist als de app langer dan %@ op de achtergrond blijft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication was cancelled by application": {
      "comment": "The error shown when authentication is cancelled by the app.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticatie is geannuleerd door de app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication was cancelled by the system": {
      "comment": "The error shown when authentication is cancelled by the system.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authenticatie is geannuleerd door het systeem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Your Identity": {
      "comment": "The 'change your identity' product feature title.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verander je identiteit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose from a range of themes to create a look that reflects your personality and style.": {
      "comment": "The 'dynamic themes' product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies uit een reeks thema's om een look te maken die bij je persoonlijkheid en stijl past."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue your purchase?": {
      "comment": "The alert title prompting the user to resume a promoted purchase.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uw aankoop voortzetten?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current Session": {
      "comment": "The string for the 'current session' section.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Huidige sessie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Did not find error code on LAError object": {
      "comment": "The error shown when an unrecognized authentication error code is returned.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen foutcode gevonden op het LAError-object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display Name": {
      "comment": "The section label above the display name field on the edit profile screen.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weergavenaam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dive even deeper into discussions with an extended 1000 character limit for your feed messages.": {
      "comment": "The subscription feed-message character-limit product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duik nog dieper in discussies met een uitgebreide limiet van 1000 tekens voor je feedberichten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic Themes": {
      "comment": "The 'dynamic themes' product feature title.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamische thema's"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elevate your status in the Kurozora community with the prestigious Pro badge next to your username, and show your support for Kurozora.": {
      "comment": "The 'unlock pro badge' product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verhoog je status in de Kurozora-community met de prestigieuze Pro-badge naast je gebruikersnaam en laat je steun voor Kurozora zien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email: we all forget our passwords 🙉": {
      "comment": "The email field placeholder during sign-up.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E-mail: we vergeten allemaal weleens ons wachtwoord 🙉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error Authenticating": {
      "comment": "The alert title shown when biometric authentication fails.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fout bij verifiëren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error Redeeming Code": {
      "comment": "The headline string for the redeem error pop-up.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fout bij inwisselen code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error Updating Profile": {
      "comment": "The alert title shown when updating the profile fails.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fout bij bijwerken profiel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found a Kurozora code in the wild? This is the place to redeem it!": {
      "comment": "The subheadline string for the Redeem view.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een Kurozora-code gevonden? Hier kun je hem inwisselen!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Animated": {
      "comment": "The 'get animated' product feature title.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kom in beweging"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Have more to say? Express yourself fully with a 500 character limit for your feed messages.": {
      "comment": "The tip jar feed-message character-limit product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meer te zeggen? Uit jezelf volledig met een limiet van 500 tekens voor je feedberichten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immediately": {
      "comment": "The string for authenticating immediately.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direct"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immerse yourself in the world of anime from the very start with serene chimes and iconic anime sounds.": {
      "comment": "The 'startup chimes' product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dompel jezelf vanaf het begin onder in de wereld van anime met serene startgeluiden en iconische animageluiden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import 📲": {
      "comment": "The import bar button on the library import screen.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importeer 📲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes %@ free trial!": {
      "comment": "The introductory free trial description, where the placeholder is the trial period.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inclusief %@ gratis proefperiode!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrate with Calendar": {
      "comment": "The 'integrate with calendar' product feature title.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Integreer met Agenda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrate your anime schedule into your calendar. Never miss an episode again with reminders for new airings.": {
      "comment": "The 'integrate with calendar' product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Integreer je animaschema in je agenda. Mis nooit meer een aflevering met herinneringen voor nieuwe uitzendingen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kurozora & Privacy": {
      "comment": "The string for the phrase 'Kurozora & Privacy'.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurozora en privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kurozora Account": {
      "comment": "The title of the account settings screen.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurozora-account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kurozora offers Sign in with Apple for users who want the extra peace of mind when it comes to security and privacy. Sign in with Apple is a convenient way to sign in to apps and sites while having more control over the information you share. Kurozora is restricted to asking only for your name and email address, and Apple won’t track your app activity or build a profile of you.": {
      "comment": "The footer string for the Sign in with Apple view.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurozora biedt Log in met Apple voor gebruikers die extra gemoedsrust willen op het gebied van beveiliging en privacy. Log in met Apple is een handige manier om in te loggen bij apps en sites terwijl u meer controle houdt over de informatie die u deelt. Kurozora mag alleen om uw naam en e-mailadres vragen, en Apple volgt uw app-activiteit niet en bouwt geen profiel van u op."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kurozora+ Required": {
      "comment": "The alert title shown when a feature requires Kurozora+.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurozora+ vereist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make your home screen stand out with premium and limited time app icons.": {
      "comment": "The 'stylish app icons' product feature description.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laat je beginscherm opvallen met premium app-symbolen voor beperkte tijd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage Subscriptions": {
      "comment": "The string for the 'manage subscriptions' settings option.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abonnementen beheren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not interactive": {
      "comment": "The error shown when authentication is not interactive.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
